# Gemini context ignore — Kartezya HR Backend
# Discovery/context filter only; not a hard security deny.
# Source (internal/, schema/), tests, go.sum, .env.example, AGENTS.md and AI docs stay available.

# Secrets — .env.example kept for schema reference
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local uploads and compiled binaries (root)
uploads/
/kartezya-hr
/main
*.exe
*.test

# Log, temp, coverage
*.log
logs/
tmp/
temp/
coverage/

# Generated Swagger — open on-demand for contract tasks
docs/docs.go
docs/swagger.json
docs/swagger.yaml
